# emacs -nw: M-x with completion (the *Completions* window), cancel,
# the buffer list, quit.
# Meta keys are typed as Escape and then the key, each a step of its
# own: fux gives Alt-v to a program that set modifyOtherKeys 1 (as emacs
# does) as CSI 27 ; 3 ; 118 ~, where xterm sends ESC v, and emacs does
# not know it.
!start 2000
\e
xrevert-b\t
\t
\x07
\x07
\x18\x02
\x18o
q
\x18\x03
